  triage:title "AX.3 QA-2 re-assessment of AX3-004: composition-level task_store() coverage still absent (LocalServiceRuntime::task_store happy path and not-installed error untested in composition.rs / service_runtime.rs)" ;
  triage:description "AX.3 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax3-qa-r2, PR #1191 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T07:37Z; confirmed by quality-mgr and rust-qa-agent) at head 116bd23b0. The rusqlite-writer-level D8 scenarios from AX3-004 are now covered, but the composition half is not: neither the composition root (crates/atm-runtime/src/composition.rs) nor crates/atm-core/src/service_runtime.rs has a test that (a) composes the runtime and resolves LocalServiceRuntime::task_store() successfully and (b) asserts the not-installed error when no TaskStore is installed. Fix: add both tests at the composition/service-runtime level. Superseding record for the partial-fix state of AX3-004; AX3-004.ttl left unmodified." ;
